Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Reduce MMC speed for compatibility

Some boards have intermittent failures when inititalizing the mmc
(might be due to using old/recycled flash chips).
---
 project/lk1st-msm8916.mk | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/project/lk1st-msm8916.mk b/project/lk1st-msm8916.mk
index 74275fa5..fa4834d2 100644
--- a/project/lk1st-msm8916.mk
+++ b/project/lk1st-msm8916.mk
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
 TARGET := msm8916
 include lk2nd/project/lk1st.mk
+DEFINES += USE_TARGET_HS200_CAPS=1
